ARTWORK

The MIT terms above cover the source code.

The navigator artwork - the case, the glass and the button faces, held in
plugin/assets - is not covered by them. It was drawn for this mod and remains
(c) 2026 abra9987, all rights reserved. Fork the code, learn from it, build on
it; please draw your own device rather than shipping this one.

